## Honest QA

Inspected both full images visually and sampled background pixels with System.Drawing. All 19 elements appear in three rows. No elements touch or overlap; no game world, readable text, labels, or watermark is visible. Materials broadly follow the dark leather and worn iron reference, with warm metallic symbols. Potion and status sprites include surrounding plaques instead of standalone silhouettes. The charge symbol differs from the requested boots. The chat panel has a greenish cast. Sprite gaps are visually about 25-45 pixels in the tightest places, so the requested minimum 40-pixel gap is not consistently met. Dimensions approximate 16:9 but are not exact.

Neither version achieves a perfectly flat pure #00FF00 background. Initial background samples include (0,0) #12F10D, (800,10) #03F804, and (800,320) #03F903. Corrected v2 samples include (0,0) #12F112, (800,10) #02F809, (800,320) #03F808, (800,900) #03F90A, and (1650,900) #03F908. Both look green, but contain colour variation; exact-colour chroma-key slicing will require cleanup. No pixel cleanup was performed. The single permitted corrective generation was used; no further generations were made.
